---
description: Always apply Stripe plugin best practices when payments or Stripe are discussed
alwaysApply: true
---

When the task involves Stripe, billing, checkout, subscriptions, webhooks, or API keys:

1. Follow the **stripe-best-practices** skill (Checkout Sessions, webhook signatures, no secrets in repo).
2. Use the **Stripe MCP** for Dashboard/API tasks when available.
3. See **stripe-integration** rule for TestingView-specific endpoints and deploy steps.

After billing/Stripe code changes on this site, redeploy with `Keytech.TestingView.Web.FE/deploy/Deploy-LocalIis.ps1`.
